t":"秋霜烈日生前操，流水行云意外诗。\n未必中兴四君子，于斯二者更兼之。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":28782,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"官舍阻雨十日不能出闷成五绝呈徐判部 其四","author":"刘过","text":"潦倒傍门羞骑马，倦游老欲寄昆山。\n留将造请嗫嚅口，慷慨狂歌泉石间。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":28783,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"官舍阻雨十日不能出闷成五绝呈徐判部 其二","author":"刘过","text":"竹隐先生名满世，自为举子已诗声。\n春风若入五花判，莫遣紫微红药惊。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":28784,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"欲游閤皂山","author":"刘过","text":"仙梯难上尘缘重，俗驾勒回仙有灵。\n烟霭模糊雨昏黑，数峰疑在眼中青。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":28785,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"春日书事","author":"刘过","text":"薄雪笼日护初晴，沙岸潮来春水生。\n间傍柳堤骑马去，一鞭春色柳风轻。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":28786,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"春归","author":"刘过","text":"百花开尽到酴醾，一片春心又欲归。\n可恨东风留不得，谩教啼鸟怨斜晖。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":28787,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"柬胡卫道 其二","author":"刘过","text":"结束弓刀鞍马间，精神矍铄我犹顽。\n褒衣博带休相笑，前带头巾金帽环。","collection"